# The ingest service's one setting (deploy/compose.yaml, profile ingest;
# docs/hands.md, "remake"). Copy to secrets/ingest.env; the file is optional.
#
# A proxy for yt-dlp, passed as --proxy (http, https, socks5 or socks5h).
# YouTube answers this box's address "Sign in to confirm you're not a bot"
# for every player client, so YouTube videos need one; TikTok downloads work
# without. It holds a login, so it is read by this container only: the hands
# never see it, and it is taken out of every error the service reports.
# INGEST_PROXY_URL=http://user:password@proxy.example:3128
